      "date": "2026-02-16T07:38:57.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹1.14 (vs ₹1.42 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.14 (down from ₹1.42 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹1.97b (up 14% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹173.7m (down 20% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 8.8% (down from 13% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 10% per year and the company’s share price has also fallen by 10% per year.",
